1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maharaja Srimat Trailokyaraja Maulibhushanawarma Dewa (Brahma) (Malim Dewa) (Maharaja Imbang Jaya) (Maharaja Mani Jaya) (Maharaja Bukit Siguntang). Maharaja kerjaaan Samgupta (hingga c1233).
2 CONT <p>--------------------</p>
2 CONT <p>aka DharmaWira IndraWarman. From Leyden's "Malay Annals" http://books.google.com/books?id=J9JAAAAAYAAJ Raja Suran Padshah was ruler of Amdan Nagara (or Amdan Nayara); later he invaded Gangga Nagara; and then invaded Glang Kiu. Raja Suran is f
2 CONC rom the city of Bijnagar in the land of Kling (Kalinga, now Orissa) [see http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gangga_Negara and http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kota_Gelanggi ]. Inscriptions from K.Gellangi tell it was raided by http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki
2 CONC /Rajendra_Chola_I in 1025.
2 CONT <p>--------------------</p>
2 CONT <p>Srimat Trailokyaraja Maulibhusana Warmadewa is also known as Sri Maha Prabu Tungga Dewa.</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Ruled since child from 1169 to 1270. (101 years reign).</p>
2 CONT <p>--------------------</p>
2 CONT <p>'''DECEASED'''</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Raja Malayu</p>
