1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rishi Marichi or Mareechi or Marishi (ṛṣi Marīci, ऋषि मरीचि) (meaning a ray of light) is the son of Brahma, the cosmic creator, and also one of the Saptarshi (Seven Great Sages Rishi), in the First Manvantara, with others being A
2 CONC tri, Angiras, Pulaha, Kratu, Pulastya, and Vashishtha
