2 CONT <p>Ahmad ibn Isma’il ibn Muhammad    =   </p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Ubaydu’lláh ibn Ahmad, “al-Mahdi”, Fatimid Caliph of Egypt (846-934)</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Muhammad ibn Ubaydu’lláh, “al-Qá’im”, Fatimid Caliph of Egypt (873-946)   =   </p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Isma’il ibn Muhammad, “al-Mansur”, Fatimid Caliph of Egypt (901-952) (d. 953)   =  </p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Princess Dihja bint al-Mansur (f3) = Qarays ibn ‘Abbad (b.c. 920)</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Isma’il ibn Qarays, Judge of Seville and Imam</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Kadi ‘Abu’l-Qasim Muhamad I ibn Isma’il, Chamberlain of Seville(1023-1042)</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>‘Abu ‘Amr ‘Abbad ibn Muhammad ll, Chamberlain of Seville </p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>‘Abu’l-Qasim Muhammad al-Mu‘tamid, Emir of Seville = I‘tamid </p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Zaida (Isabella) (1075-1107) (f3) = King Alfonso VI de León y Castile </p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Sancha, (F4) Princess of Leon and Castile  = Rodrigo Gonzales (“El Franco”)</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Rodrigo Rodriguez de Lara (b. 1123)    =    Elvira Garcia de Azarga</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Sancha Rodriguez de Lara (f5)  =    Gonsalo Ruis II Giron (d. 1234)</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Aldonza Gonzales de Giron (f6)    =     Ramiro Fruelaz, Señor de Cifontes </p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Aldonza Ramirez Fruelaz (f7)   =   Arias Diaz de Valderabano de Asturias</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Maria de Henestrosa (f8) = Fernan Gonzalez de Henestrosa</p>
