2 CONT <p>Dhananada [Xandrames], King of Magadha = sister of Dhana Nanda of Magadha</p>
2 CONT <p>Nandini  = Chandragupta Maurya [Sandrakottes], Mahārāja of India (324-301 BCE)</p>
2 CONT <p>Princess Subhadrangi Dharmi = Bindusar/Vindusara, Mahārāja of India (301-269 BCE)</p>
2 CONT <p>Ashoka “the Great”, Devanampiya Piyadassi (304-232 BCE) = Tissarakkha Karuvaki</p>
2 CONT <p>Kunala, King of Kashmir = dau. King Devapala of Nepal & a Tibetan princess</p>
2 CONT <p>Brihadratha [II], Mahārāja of India (187-181 BCE) = Princess Berenice of Bactria</p>
2 CONT <p>Princess Sundari of India = King Demetrius of Bactria (200-185 BCE)</p>
2 CONT <p>Princess Alexandra of Bactria = King Agathocles of Bactria (165-160 BCE)</p>
2 CONT <p>Princess Agathoclea of Bactria = Menander I (Soter), King of Bactria (155-150 BCE)</p>
2 CONT <p>Strato I, King of Bactria = sister of Vasumitra, Mahārāja of India</p>
