2 CONT <p>Princess of Bactria = Kuyula Kadphises [Kilu-dzilu-kiak], King of the Kushans</p>
2 CONT <p>Vima Kadphises of the Kushans = granddaughter of Susaramana, Mahārāja of India</p>
2 CONT <p>Kanishka I (Devaputra), King of the Kushans</p>
