1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HE WAS A CONTEMPORARY OF GAUTAMA  BUDDHA AND KING BIMBISARA OF MAGADHA. HIS SISTER KOUSHALA DEVI, WAS MARRIED TO BIMBISARA. THE CITY OF KASHI  (VARANASI) WAS GIVEN AS A DOWRY TO HER. AFTER BIMBISARA  WAS MURDERED BY HIS OWN SON A
2 CONC JATSHATRU, PRASENJIT UNDERTOOK A LONG SERIES OF WARS WITH AJATSHATRU. HE ALSO RESPECTED BUDDHA, WHO WAS ALSO A KSHATRIYA FROM SOLAR DYNASTY. IN BUDDHIST LITERATURE HE IS ADDRESSES AS "PASENADI." .
