1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HE PERFORMED THE ASHWAMEDHA YAJNA, BUT AS THE RITUALS WERE CONCLUDING A RAKSHASA TRICKED HIM INTO SERVING HUMAN MEAT TO BRAHMINS, INCLUDING RISHI VASISHTA. HE WAS THEN CURSED BY BRAHMINS.  HE WANTED TO CURSE THEM BACK, BUT HIS WI
2 CONC FE PREVENTED HIM.  HE SPENT TWELVE YEARS IN EXILE IN THE FOREST.
