1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HIS ORIGINAL NAME WAS SATYAVRATA, BUT COMMITTED THREE (TRI) SIN, AND HENCE GOT THE NAME TRISHANKU. FIRST WHILE HE WAS A PRINCE, HE MISBEHAVED AND WAS TEMPORARILY EXILED FROM KINGDOM. NEXT HE KILLED THE MILCH COW OF HIS PRECEPTO
2 CONC R VASISHTA. HIS THIRD SIN WAS THAT HE USED THE UN SANCTIFIED MEAT OF HIS KILL AS FOOD. TRISHANKU ALSO HAD A DESIRE TO ASCEND TO HEAVEN IN HIS MORTAL BODY. AFTER VASISHTA REFUSED HIM THIS BOON, SINCE IT IS AGAINST NATURE TO ASCEND INTO HEAVEN A
2 CONC S A MORTAL, THE SAGE VISWAMITRA, VASISHTA'S RIVAL, CREATED ANTHER HEAVEN FOR HIM, CALLED "TRISHANKU'S HEAVEN", AND LOCATED IN  MID-AIR. HIS SON WAS HARISHCHANDRA WHO IS KNOWN FOR HIS HONESTY, TRUTH AND DEVOTION TO DUTY OR DHARMA.
