2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>OR "NEFERU-RA URMAAT""MAET.NEFRU.RE'" (EGYPTIAN NAME ONLY KNOWN); ARRIVED IN
2 CONT <p>EGYPT 1246 BC</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
