2 CONT <p>Hattusili II</p>
2 CONT <p>From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Hattusili II was a king of the Hittite Empire (New kingdom) in the early 14th century BC.</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>His existence is disputed.</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Preceded by:</p>
2 CONT <p>Tudhaliya II Hittite king Succeeded by:</p>
2 CONT <p>Tudhaliya III</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>SOURCE NOTES:</p>
