1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muwatalli_I
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Biography</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Muwatalli killed his predecessor Huzziya II. He was the Chief of the Royal Bodyguard of Huzziya, but later he killed him. He may have been Huzziya's younger brother.</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Muwatalli's Chief of the Royal Bodyguard was called Muwa. Muwattalli himself was killed in a palace by Himuili, the Chief of the Palace Servants, and Kantuzili, the Overseer of the Gold Chariot Fighters.[1] His wife was called Walanni.[2]
