2 _UID 68907dabaf83d1f097eb28d0434178f9
2 RIN MH:IF10810
1 FAMC @F14107@
1 FAMS @F14103@
1 NOTE The wife of George who was beaten by him when he was drunk. She was the person who first discovered agriculture but he was the first person to discover alcohol.
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>She was an alcoholic too, and did care deeply for him. She outlived George
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>However she did not run Gobeklitepe as her son Malcolm Mureybet immediately took over.
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>George Gobekli was monogamous so all his descendants descend from her too.
